Package: reims-web
Version: 0.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Reims Desktop Team <dev@reims-desktop.org>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-fastapi, python3-uvicorn, scrot, xdotool, x11-utils, reims-core (>= 0.1.0), reims-gui (>= 0.1.0)
Description: Proxmox-style Web Console for Reims Desktop
 Browser-based VM manager (FastAPI + vanilla JS SPA) listening on :8006,
 reusing the Qt-free core layer of reims-gui to control reims-ctl:
 live host charts, diagnostics, GPU list, VM lifecycle and creation wizard.
 Reims Desktop is an independent community project with no affiliation with
 Apple Inc. or the upstream Reims (steelbrain/reims-vgpu) project.
